.TH SIEGE_SIM 1 "2026-11-19" "SiegeSeal 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
siege_sim \- the Siege of Vharos, a non-repudiation demonstration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B siege_sim
.RB [ \-\-no\-color ]
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.RB [ \-\-help ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs a five-act story. Three armies besiege the city of Vharos, every courier
rides past its walls, and the city attacks each letter: tampering, forgery,
replay, rerouting, burned couriers, delays and fake receipts. Every attack is
caught. A closing tribunal shows that no army can deny what it signed or
received, or tell two allies two different stories.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-no\-color
Plain output. Colour is also off when output is not a terminal, or when
.B NO_COLOR
is set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR siegeseal (1)
